try.is_successful\n  - artifact: Final UI state snapshot with `current_activity` and `ui_elements`\n    question: Does `current_activity` contain `DeskClock`, and does any UI element exactly match the target timer by the evaluator's accepted text or content-description format?\n    support:\n    - official/install/.venv311/lib/python3.11/site-packages/android_world/task_evals/single/clock.py::ClockTimerEntry.is_successful\n    - official/install/.venv311/lib/python3.11/site-packages/android_world/task_evals/single/clock.py::_is_timer_set\n  success_if:\n  - text: The run record identifies the target hours/minutes/seconds, and the final UI snapshot shows a `DeskClock` activity with at least one UI element whose text or content description exactly matches the evaluator's accepted representation for those target values.\n    support:\n    - official/install/.venv311/lib/python3.11/site-packages/android_world/task_evals/single/clock.py::ClockTimerEntry.is_successful\n    - official/install/.venv311/lib/python3.11/site-packages/android_world/task_evals/single/clock.py::_is_timer_set\n    - official/install/.venv311/lib/python3.11/site-packages/android_world/task_evals/single/clock.py::ClockTimerEntry.schema\n  fail_if:\n  - text: With the target hours/minutes/seconds known and a final UI snapshot available, fail if the snapshot is not in `DeskClock` or no UI element exactly matches either accepted representation for the target values.\n    support:\n    - official/install/.venv311/lib/python3.11/site-packages/android_world/task_evals/single/clock.py::ClockTimerEntry.is_successful\n    - official/install/.venv311/lib/python3.11/site-packages/android_world/task_evals/single/clock.py::_is_timer_set\n  undecided_if:\n  - text: The retained evidence does not reveal the run's target hours/minutes/seconds.\n    rationale: Without the task parameters, the evaluator's exact-match check cannot be applied.\n  - text: The retained evidence lacks a final UI snapshot containing both `